the Apache Arrow C Data Interface and C Stream Interface. Its declarations of
the C structures ArrowSchema, ArrowArray and ArrowArrayStream are adapted from
the Apache Arrow specification
(https://arrow.apache.org/docs/format/CDataInterface.html and
https://arrow.apache.org/docs/format/CStreamInterface.html), whose definitions
are available under the Apache License, Version 2.0. No Apache Arrow library is
